I found a dead clown in the woods, but who knows?

329
00:13:54,071 --> 00:13:57,191
嘿 你一定就是小寿星了
Hey. Oh. Well, you must be the birthday boy.

330
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,760
是你吗 小卡舅夫
Is that you, Uncle Cam?

331
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,420
不 我是小丑菲茨宝
No. I'm Fizbo the clown.

332
00:14:01,460 --> 00:14:02,920
我不知道小卡舅夫是谁
I don't know who this Uncle Cam is,

333
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:04,620
但听上去他似乎很帅 不是吗
but he sure sounds handsome, doesn't he?

334
00:14:05,291 --> 00:14:08,521
-谁喜欢气球拧的动物 -我 我
- Hey, who likes balloon animals? - I do! I do!

335
00:14:08,631 --> 00:14:11,352
那只是小卡 只是小卡而已
It's just Cam. It's just Cam.

336
00:14:11,352 --> 00:14:13,712
-你还好吧 -什么 当然了
- You all right? - What? Yeah.

337
00:14:13,712 --> 00:14:17,952
我只是对小丑有种复杂的情节
Just have kind of a complicated relationship with clowns.

338
00:14:18,012 --> 00:14:20,372
彼此彼此
Well, join the club.

339
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:27,740
听着 我之前太刻意勉强自己装成搞笑的人
Look, I came on strong with that whole funny guy bit.

340
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:30,060
现在在你面前的是真实的我
This is me just being myself.

341
00:14:31,180 --> 00:14:33,840
好吧 你知道那边那个男生是谁吗
Okay. Hey, do you know who that boy is over there?

342
00:14:34,300 --> 00:14:37,260
那是迪兰 海莉的男朋友
Oh. That's Dylan. He's Haley's boyfriend.

343
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:40,220
他真是又高又帅
He's so cute and tall.

344
00:14:41,140 --> 00:14:44,400
我还在发育呢 别老挑我的短处
I'm still growing. Give me a break.

345
00:14:45,422 --> 00:14:48,312
不好意思 小姐 这只小狗需要一个新家
Pardon me, miss, but this little doggy needs a new home.

346
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:49,480
谢谢你
Oh, thank you.

347
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,360
你的装扮真是很夺人眼球啊
That's quite an impressive getup you got there.

348
00:14:54,382 --> 00:14:56,022
谢谢 杰 噢 对了
Thank you, Jay. Oh, by the way,

349
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,320
你的肩膀上有点东西
you have something on your shoulder.

350
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,360
真有你的
That's good.

351
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,540
别担心 什么都没有
Never mind. It was nothing.

352
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:04,940
适可而止
We're done here.

353
00:15:14,573 --> 00:15:17,543
你把这些动物都关在动物园还是哪里
So, do you keep these at a zoo or something?

354
00:15:17,543 --> 00:15:19,893
-不 都放在我家里 -真棒
- No. I just keep 'em at my place. - That's awesome.

355
00:15:20,220 --> 00:15:21,500
我家只有一只猫
I only have a cat.

356
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:24,140
是吗 我曾经也有过一只猫
Yeah? I used to have a cat.

357
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:26,420
我之前是想故意惹你生气
I was just messing with you before,

358
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:29,580
但他现在竟然还在跟她说话
but seriously, he's still talking to her.

359
00:15:29,633 --> 00:15:32,363
-哇 好凉啊 -姐这就出马
- Wow. Cool. - On it.

360
00:15:32,423 --> 00:15:35,073
-其实 这是... -我感觉像布兰妮一样
- You know, this is one of- - I feel like Britney Spears.

361
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:36,700
你好搞笑哦
You're so funny.

362
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,880
你这确实很像布兰妮MV中的造型
You kind of do look like Britney Spears.

363
00:15:39,893 --> 00:15:41,134
-真的吗 -我开玩笑的
- Really? - I'm just kidding.

364
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:43,640
反正 这只大概是我的最爱了
Anyway, this is probably my favorite.

365
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,060
嘿 丛林女郎
Hey, jungle lady?

366
00:15:45,604 --> 00:15:47,984
似乎 你的一只爬虫跑出来了
I think- I think one of your bugs got out.

367
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:49,660
什么 这只吗
What? This one?

368
00:15:49,680 --> 00:15:51,900
就是这只盒子里的 盒子歪倒了
This box thing here- It's on its side.

369
00:15:52,060 --> 00:15:54,140
-老天啊 跑哪儿去了 -没事吧
- Oh, my God. Where did it go? - Is everything okay?

370
00:15:54,234 --> 00:15:57,224
不 我丢了一只毒蝎子 我得找到它
No. I lost a poisonous scorpion, and I need to find it.

371
00:15:57,440 --> 00:16:00,660
好了孩子们 都把裤腿扎进袜子里
Okay, kids, let's all tuck our pants into our socks.

372
00:16:01,084 --> 00:16:02,734
不要去阴暗潮湿的角落
Avoid shady, moist places,

373
00:16:02,734 --> 00:16:05,264
我们来玩个游戏 叫做"当心脚下"
and let's make a game of looking where we step.

374
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,180
-他没事吧 -我们现在能探望他吗
- Is he okay? - Can we see him?

375
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:15,980
医生正在给他诊治
He's in with the doctor right now.

376
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:18,960
这种事就是常发生的 对吧
These things happen, right?

377
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,640
不管你多么的小心
No matter how careful you are.

378
00:16:20,764 --> 00:16:23,784
嘿 瞧瞧外公送了我什么 十字弓
Hey, look what Grandpa gave me- a crossbow.

379
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,400
-宝贝 那东西看着不安全啊 -别担心
- Sweetie, that does not look safe. - Don't worry.

380
00:16:25,624 --> 00:16:27,024
他会教我怎么用的
He's gonna show me how to use it.

381
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:29,400
那正是 我担心的地方
That's what... I'm afraid of.

382
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,800
快过来 准备好了吗
Come on. Ready?

383
00:16:33,020 --> 00:16:35,460
噢 老天 你不会是在做梳套吧
Oh, my God. You are not making comb sheaths.

384
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:37,420
我就是的 我知道的 又老套又无趣
I am, and I know. It's really lame.

385
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:38,160
每个人都讨厌
Everybody hates it.

386
00:16:38,285 --> 00:16:40,345
不 就像是当年唐娜·瑞格比的派对
No. It's just like, uh, Donna Rigby's party.

387
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:43,300
就是啊 太对了 我这边小珠子什么的都有
Exactly! Yes! And I have the beads and everything.

388
00:16:44,100 --> 00:16:45,540
太棒了 真是太棒了
Amazing. This is awesome.

389
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:48,680
所以 小卡是个小丑哈
So... Cam's a clown.

390
00:16:49,785 --> 00:16:50,816
是啊
Yeah.

391
00:16:50,925 --> 00:16:54,095
-我绝对射到你了 -那是我家那位小丑
- I totally got you. - And there's mine.

392
00:16:54,095 --> 00:16:54,855
你有没有觉得很怪
You think it's weird

393
00:16:54,855 --> 00:16:57,225
-我们姐弟俩找的对象都 -自由不羁吗
- that we both chose people who were so- uninhibited?

394
00:16:57,225 --> 00:16:59,695
我本想说令人尴尬的 不过你说的也对
I was gonna say "Embarrassing," But yeah.

395
00:16:59,765 --> 00:17:03,205
瞧瞧他们 派对因他们而充满活力
Look at them now. They're the life of the party.

396
00:17:03,265 --> 00:17:06,205
我必须承认 尽管他很疯狂
Uh, you know, I gotta say, for all his craziness,

397
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:07,820
但我爱我家那位小丑
I love my clown.

398
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:10,440
姐也是 有他们在真的很好
Me too. They're good for us.

399
00:17:10,815 --> 00:17:12,925
要是我 肯定把派对气氛给毁了
I would've totally tanked this party.

400
00:17:12,985 --> 00:17:15,915
而我则会在加油站被人暴揍一顿
And I would've gotten my butt kicked at a gas station.

401
00:17:16,505 --> 00:17:19,595
-什么 -菲茨宝可是个不好惹的大坏蛋哟
- Sorry? - Turns out Fizbo is a real bad-ass.

402
00:17:20,286 --> 00:17:22,766
蝎子 有蝎子 有蝎子
Scorpion! Scorpion! Scorpion!

403
00:17:22,826 --> 00:17:23,727
有蝎子
Scorpion!

404
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:30,860
不不不 靠得太近 离我太近
No, no. Too close. Too close. Too close.

405
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:32,240
搞毛啊
What the hell?

406
00:17:33,356 --> 00:17:34,697
噢 糟糕
Oh, crap!

407
00:17:34,796 --> 00:17:36,416
-冷静 -发生什么事了
- Calm down. - What happened?

408
00:17:36,416 --> 00:17:37,237
我们发射了十字弓
We fired the crossbow.

409
00:17:37,346 --> 00:17:39,966
不 我知道的 天啊 射中蹦床了
No, I know. Oh, my God. It's right there.

410
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,480
比安卡 我来了
Bianca, I'm coming.

411
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:50,460
-还有谁在里面 -快出来
- Who else is in there? - Get out!

412
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:57,600
事实证明我不是甜心帅哥 也不是幽默达人
It turns out I'm not the sweet guy or the funny guy.

413
00:17:57,786 --> 00:18:00,176
不 曼尼 别进去 千万不要
No, Manny, don't go in! Por favor!

414
00:18:00,246 --> 00:18:02,226
我必须进去
I must!

415
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,300
我来了
I'm coming!

416
00:18:08,220 --> 00:18:09,970
曼尼·迪尔加多是个用行动说话的男人
Manny Delgado is a man of action.

417
00:18:15,540 --> 00:18:17,080
等等 我的狗狗还在里面
Wait. My dog is still in there.

418
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:19,720
我马上就回来
I'll be right back.

419
00:18:29,567 --> 00:18:32,667
噢 我的胳膊
Ow! My arm!

420
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,320
小宝贝 卢克
Sweetie? Luke?

421
00:18:34,737 --> 00:18:36,207
-怎么了 小老弟 -出什么事了
- What happened, buddy? - What happened?

422
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:36,860
出什么事了 宝贝
What happened, honey?

423
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,280
嘿 嘿 怎么回事
Hey, hey. What happened?

424
00:18:38,657 --> 00:18:41,967
-我踩在这些小珠子上滑倒了 -糟糕
- I slipped on these stupid beads. - Oops.

425
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:43,140
来 先起来
Come on. Here we go.

426
00:18:45,287 --> 00:18:46,768
他怎么样了
How is he?

427
00:18:46,877 --> 00:18:48,597
-他会没事的 -老天啊
- Oh, he's gonna be fine. - Ay, Dios mio.

428
00:18:48,667 --> 00:18:50,517
小宝贝 你怎么样啊 孩子
Hi, honey. How are you, kid?

429
00:18:50,587 --> 00:18:54,027
-他出来了 -小可怜
- Oh, there he is. - Pobrecito.

430
00:18:54,677 --> 00:18:56,059
你个可怜的孩子
You poor thing.

431
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,180
哇 大家都来了啊
Wow. Everybody's here.

432
00:18:58,180 --> 00:19:00,280
我们当然得来了 你的小翅膀怎么样了
Of course we are. How's that busted flipper?

433
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:02,400
-没事 -今天的事真遗憾 小老弟
- Okay. - Sorry about today, buddy.

434
00:19:02,458 --> 00:19:03,908
我们明年再给你办个完美的生日派对
We'll try again next year, huh?

435
00:19:03,978 --> 00:19:06,458
你在说笑吗 这是有史以来最棒的生日了
Are you kidding? This was the best birthday ever.

436
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:08,940
-什么 -我打了个石膏
- What? - I got a cast.

437
00:19:09,268 --> 00:19:11,918
-你喜欢打石膏吗 -我一直想要一个的
- You like a cast? - I've always wanted one.

438
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,640
-几周后 里面就会发臭 -恶
- After a few weeks, they start to smell. -Ew!

439
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:16,800
你真是个怪胎 你知道吗
You are so weird, you know that?

440
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:18,360
-我可以在上面签名吗 -当然
- Can I sign it? - Sure.

441
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:20,280
-嘿 我先来 -这边
- Hey. Me first. - Here.

442
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,100
如果你在派对举办之前问我
If you'd asked me before the party...

443
00:19:22,100 --> 00:19:24,740
是否希望发生一系列灾难的连锁反应
if I wanted there to be a chain reaction of disasters...

444
00:19:24,928 --> 00:19:28,638
导致卢克摔伤了胳膊 我很可能会说不
that led to Luke breaking his arm, I probably would've said no.

445
00:19:28,748 --> 00:19:31,688
-可能吗 -可...绝对 绝对不希望
- Probably? - Prob- Definite- Definitely not.

446
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:32,860
不希望发生那种事
Would not want that.

447
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:36,460
但是 不管怎么样
But, one way or another,

448
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:38,440
卢克在他生日这天是众人关心的焦点
Luke was the center of attention on his birthday,

449
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:40,120
而且全家人都聚在一起
and the whole family was together...

450
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,760
那正是家庭生日会该有的样子
just the way it should be.

451
00:19:44,559 --> 00:19:47,749
菲茨宝快递 我带蛋糕来啦
Fizbo delivery! I brought the cake!

452
00:19:47,809 --> 00:19:49,709
好耶
Bravo!

453
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,540
我心理承受不住
I can't do this.

454
00:19:52,729 --> 00:19:54,709
天啊 我得出去
Oh, God. I'm out.

455
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:00,680
蛋糕
Cake.

456
00:20:03,289 --> 00:20:06,109
快吹蜡烛 快吹蜡烛
Blow the candles. Blow the candles.

457
00:20:10,829 --> 00:20:13,729
比安卡·道格拉斯今晚给我打了3个电话
Bianca Douglas called me three times tonight.

458
00:20:13,799 --> 00:20:15,419
我不打算说假话骗你们
I'm not gonna lie to you.

459
00:20:15,419 --> 00:20:17,069
我感觉快被那姑娘缠死了
I'm starting to feel smothered.

460
00:20:17,919 --> 00:20:21,319
我真的很喜欢我的石膏 但里面开始痒了
I really like my cast, but it's starting to itch.

461
00:20:21,600 --> 00:20:24,060
幸好有我妈特制的挠痒神器
Good thing my mom made me this personal scratcher.

462
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:27,280
好东西用了才知道
Oh, that's good stuff.

463
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:30,180
如果有别的女人想勾搭你的男人
If another woman is messing with your man,

464
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:31,820
你一定要先发制人
you have to get proactive.

465
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:33,940
我不管她有多漂亮
I don't care how pretty she is

466
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:36,400
或者她有多少只恶心的爬虫
or how many stupid reptiles she has.

467
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,940
只要她想抢我的东西
She tries to take what's mine,

468
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,920
我就不择手段坑死你
girlfriend's gonna get stung.
